  "Designing your business card has never been this easier. With vCard, you can compose your business card within minutes, and it’s effortless, elegant, and free. vCard is always in your pocket without running or tearing out. Easily update your digital business card with our user-friendly dashboard, so you won’t need to re-print your business card again.": "Det har aldrig været nemmere at designe dit visitkort. ",
