  "vCard create a digital business card that helps you reach more customers": "vCard opret et digitalt visitkort, der hjælper dig med at nå ud til flere kunder",
  "Stop wasting money on Expensive Hard Copy Business Cards": "Stop med at spilde penge på dyre papir-visitkort",
  "A vCard is an electronic business or personal card and also the name of an industry specification for the kind of communication exchange that is done on business or personal cards. You may have seen a vCard attached to an email note someone has sent you.": "Et vCard er et elektronisk forretnings- eller personligt kort og også navnet på en branchespecifikation for den form for kommunikationsudveksling, der udføres på visitkort eller personlige kort. ",
  "Self-manageable and intuitive": "Selvstyrende og intuitiv",
  "vCard is fast, easy and intuitive! You only need a few steps to have your own virtual card. Manage your business` cards in seconds and modify any content with immediate application through an easy and intuitive platform.": "vCard er hurtigt, nemt og intuitivt! ",
  "Send and save contacts as vCards": "Send og gem kontakter som vCards",
  "VCF (Virtual Card Format) is a digital file format for storing contact information. The format is widely used for data interchange among popular information exchange applications. A VCF file usually contains information such as contact’s name, phone number, email. Being supported by email clients and services, there is no loss of data during the transfer of contacts via using the vCard format. The media type for VCF file format is text/vcard.": "VCF (Virtual Card Format) er et digitalt filformat til lagring af kontaktoplysninger. ",
  "Smarten your business cards.": "Gør dine visitkort smartere.",
  "Digital business cards also known as virtual business cards and e business cards are like the digital makeover that the paper cards have needed for a long time.": "Digitale visitkort også kendt som virtuelle visitkort og e visitkort er som den digitale makeover, som papirkortene har haft brug for i lang tid.",
  "Choose what to share!": "Vælg, hvad du vil dele!",
  "Our vcards are self-manageable, therefore, you’ll always be in control of the information you’re sharing. Centralize all your social media profiles and make your community grow.": "Vores vcards er selv-administrerbare, derfor vil du altid have kontrol over de oplysninger, du deler. ",
  "The most cost-effective way to expand your reach": "Den mest omkostningseffektive måde at udvide din rækkevidde på",
  "Customize your digital business card to match your brand.Choose from 21 beautiful themes with it`s unique colors.Add,modify update your business information quickly and easily": "Tilpas dit digitale visitkort, så det matcher dit brand.Vælg mellem 21 smukke temaer med dets unikke farver.Tilføj, modificer opdatere dine virksomhedsoplysninger hurtigt og nemt",
